ROLLBACK PROCEDURE:
-------------------
If rollback is necessary:
1. Restore ProductRepository.cs from version control
2. Replace using Npgsql with using Microsoft.Data.SqlClient
3. Replace all NpgsqlConnection with SqlConnection
4. Replace all NpgsqlCommand with SqlCommand
5. Replace all NpgsqlDataReader with SqlDataReader
6. Restore AdoCore.csproj to use Microsoft.Data.SqlClient package
7. Run dotnet restore and dotnet build
8. Test against SQL Server database

SECURITY CONSIDERATIONS:
------------------------
- Npgsql uses parameterized queries by default (already implemented)
- Connection string security remains important (encrypt sensitive data)
- Regular security updates recommended for Npgsql package
- Follow PostgreSQL security best practices
- Review Npgsql security advisories regularly

